A wobbly, hand-drawn orange arrow in the [[frutiger-aero|Frutiger Aero]] style, with a soft glossy highlight down its middle and a thick dark outline. It has a see-through background, so it can sit on top of a diagram, a screenshot or a page of notes to point at something. It points up, so turn it to aim it where you need.
